{"version":1,"id":"olivia-rodrigo-get-him-back","title":"Get Him Back!","artist":"Olivia Rodrigo","key":"D","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/olivia-rodrigo/get-him-back/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Daniel Leonard Nigro and Olivia Isabel Rodrigo","chords":[{"symbol":"A#","canonical":"A#","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F","canonical":"F","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,9,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Intro]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"One, two, three","columns":15,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Wait, is this the song with the drums?","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I met a guy in the summer, and I left him in the spring","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":50,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"He argued with me about everything","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"He had an ego and a temper, and a wandering eye","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"He said he's six foot two, and I'm like, \"Dude, nice try\"","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"But he was so much fun, and he had such weird friends","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"And he would take us out to parties, and the night would never end","columns":66,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":63,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Another song, another club, another bar, another dance","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"And when hе said, \"Something wrong?\", he'd just fly me to Francе","columns":64,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":9,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":48,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"So I miss him some nights when I'm feelin' depressed","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"'Til I remember every time he made a pass on my friend","columns":54,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":9,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":48,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Do I love him? Do I hate him? I guess it's up and down","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":51,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"If I had to choose, I would say it right now","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna get him back","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna make him really jealous, wanna make him feel bad","columns":56,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":54,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I wanna get him back","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause then again, I really miss him, and it makes me real sad","columns":62,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":51,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I want sweet revenge","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And I want him again","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to get him back (Back, back)","columns":37,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F","column":36,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"So I write him all these letters, then I throw them in the trash","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I miss the way he kisses and the way he made me laugh","columns":62,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":9,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":61,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, I pour my little heart out, but as I'm hitting \"send\"","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"I picture all the faces of my disappointed friends","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Because everyone knew all of the shit that he'd do","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"He said I was the only girl, but that just wasn't the truth","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":60,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"And when I told him how he hurt me, he told me I was trippin'","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":64,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"But I am my father's daughter, so maybe I could fix him","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna get him back","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna make him really jealous, wanna make him feel bad","columns":56,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":54,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I wanna get him back","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause then again, I really miss him, and it makes me real sad","columns":62,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":51,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I want sweet revenge","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"And I want him again","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to get him back (Again?)","columns":34,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F","column":33,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to get him back (Back, back)","columns":37,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":36,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"section","text":"[Ponte]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna key his car (I want to get him back)","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna make him lunch (And then I, I want to get him back)","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":46,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna break his heart (Then I, I want to get him back)","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"Then be the one to stitch it up","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"(And then I, I want to get him back)","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"Wanna kiss his face (And then I, I want to get him back)","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"lyric","text":"With an uppercut (Then I, I want to get him back)","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna meet his mom (And then I, I want to get him back)","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"lyric","text":"Just to tell her, her son sucks","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":26,