iss him, and it makes me real sad","columns":62,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":51,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-67","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I want sweet revenge","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":20,"beat":1}]},{"id":"line-68","kind":"lyric","text":"And I want him again","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-69","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to get him back (Again?)","columns":34,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F","column":33,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-70","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to get him back (Back, back)","columns":37,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":36,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-71","kind":"section","text":"[Terceira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-72","kind":"instrumental","text":"(       )","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":6,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-73","kind":"lyric","text":"I'll get him, I'll get him, I'll get him, I'll get him back (Woo-hoo)","columns":69,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":47,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":55,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-74","kind":"lyric","text":"Get him back (Come on, come on)","columns":31,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":28,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-75","kind":"lyric","text":" I'ma get him so good (Woo), he won't even know what hit him","columns":60,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":15,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":44,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F","column":58,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-76","kind":"lyric","text":"He's gonna love me and hate me at the same time","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-77","kind":"lyric","text":"(Get back, girl, you better get him back)","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-78","kind":"lyric","text":"(Got it?) No, got it","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-79","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I don't know, I got him good, I got him really good","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[]}]}